  "instruction": "Enable the Windows On-Screen Keyboard as a motor accessibility aid and keep it enabled throughout the task. Open the provided Bills.ods spreadsheet in LibreOffice Calc. Update the Electricity bill status from `Unpaid` to `Paid` and enter the payment date as `15/10/2026`. Save the spreadsheet.",
  "source": "Local Spreadsheet: assets/Bills.ods",
  "gt_steps": [
